{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37750","headline":"寄赠杨夔处士 · 郑谷","name":"寄赠杨夔处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结茅秪约钓鱼台，溅水鸬鷀去又回。\n春卧瓮边听酒熟，露吟庭际待花开。\n三江胜景遨游徧，百氏羣书讲贯来。\n国步未安风雅薄，可能高尚掞天才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}